---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout><main>

    

    <section class="relative bg-pattern text-white py-20 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
                
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-gold/10 border border-brand-gold/30 text-brand-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-feather-pointed"></i> Escritor & Catedrático Hispanista
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-bold text-stone-100 leading-tight">
                        Pionero del <span class="text-brand-gold italic">Relato Noir</span> y Maestro de <span class="underline decoration-brand-gold/50">5 Idiomas</span>.
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-lg text-stone-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-light">
                        Bienvenido al espacio oficial del Profesor Ahmed Oubali. Creador de novelas policiacas, ensayos de semiótica y narrativa histórica, docente de 5 lenguas globales y divulgador académico con acceso libre en PDF.
                    </p>
                    
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4">
                        <a href="#works" class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-brand-gold text-brand-900 font-semibold hover:bg-yellow-400 transition shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> Explorar Obras
                        </a>
                        <a href="#pdf-library" class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-medium border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm transition flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf text-red-400"></i> Libros en PDF
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Quick Stats -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 text-center sm:text-left">
                        <div>
                            <span class="block text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-gold">5</span>
                            <span class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Idiomas Impartidos</span>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="block text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-gold">15+</span>
                            <span class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Novelas & Ensayos</span>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="block text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-gold">100%</span>
                            <span class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Acceso Gratuito PDF</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
                    <div class="relative w-full max-w-md">
                        <!-- Decorative Frame -->
                        <div class="absolute -inset-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-gold/40 to-brand-crimson/40 blur-xl opacity-70"></div>
                        <div class="relative bg-stone-900 border border-stone-700/80 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-6">
                            <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-xl bg-stone-800 overflow-hidden relative border border-stone-700">
                                <img src="https://placehold.co/600x750/3d1e11/f5e6d3?text=Prof.+Ahmed+Oubali" alt="Profesor Ahmed Oubali" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                                <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/40 to-transparent p-4 text-center">
                                    <p class="font-serif text-lg text-stone-100 font-semibold">Ahmed Oubali</p>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-brand-gold">Catedrático & Precursor del Relato Noir</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-stone-800/80 p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 text-xs text-stone-300 space-y-2">
                                <p class="italic">"La literatura es el puente entre culturas, y el lenguaje es la llave para cruzarlo."</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="py-20 bg-stone-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-stone-900 mb-4">Sobre el Autor y Profesor</h2>
                <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-brand-crimson mx-auto rounded-full mb-6"></div>
                <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
                    Catedrático, crítico semiótico y novelista hispanista marroquí. Pionero del relato policiaco y noir en el Magreb, dedicado al estudio filológico, la docencia de 5 idiomas y la producción ensayística sobre literatura comparada.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-6">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Docencia Políglota</h3>
                    <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Trayectoria de excelencia en la enseñanza superior y formación lingüística práctica en español, francés, inglés, alemán y árabe.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-100 text-red-800 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-6">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-ninja"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Novela Negra y Policiaca</h3>
                    <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Autor de aclamadas novelas como <em>Chivos Expiatorios</em>, <em>Narcolepsia</em> y <em>Perfidia de Áspid</em>, referentes de la narrativa de misterio.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-6">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-book-bookmark"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Semiótica y Difusión PDF</h3>
                    <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Comprometido con la difusión libre del conocimiento ofreciendo ensayos filológicos y semióticos para descarga directa en PDF.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="languages" class="py-20 bg-white border-y border-stone-200">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end mb-12">
                <div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-crimson uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Área Académica</span>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-stone-900">Enseñanza & Cursos de 5 Idiomas</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="text-stone-600 max-w-md mt-4 md:mt-0 text-sm">
                    Metodología pedagógica especializada orientada a estudiantes, investigadores y profesionales en 5 lenguas clave.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Grid of 5 Languages -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
                
                <!-- Spanish -->
                <div class="bg-stone-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 hover:border-brand-gold transition group">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                        <span class="text-3xl">🇪🇸</span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 rounded-full">Avanzado / Literario</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-brand-crimson transition">Español</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Análisis semiótico, redacción académica, hispanismo y análisis del texto literario.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- French -->
                <div class="bg-stone-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 hover:border-brand-gold transition group">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                        <span class="text-3xl">🇫🇷</span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 rounded-full">Universitario</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-brand-crimson transition">Francés (Français)</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Expresión escrita, literatura francófona, traducción y formación lingüística.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- English -->
                <div class="bg-stone-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 hover:border-brand-gold transition group">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                        <span class="text-3xl">🇬🇧</span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 rounded-full">Global / Académico</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-brand-crimson transition">Inglés (English)</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Comprensión de textos científicos, comunicación fluida y análisis textual.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- German -->
                <div class="bg-stone-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 hover:border-brand-gold transition group">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                        <span class="text-3xl">🇩🇪</span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 rounded-full">Estructurado</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-brand-crimson transition">Alemán (Deutsch)</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Bases gramaticales sólidas, lectura técnica y diálogo expresivo.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Arabic -->
                <div class="bg-stone-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 hover:border-brand-gold transition group">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                        <span class="text-3xl">🇲🇦</span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 rounded-full">Clásico / Dialectal</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-brand-crimson transition">Árabe (العربية)</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Árabe estándar culto, retórica, lingüística y patrimonio literario magrebí.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="works" class="py-20 bg-stone-900 text-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-gold uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Publicaciones Bibliográficas</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-stone-100">Novelas & Ensayos Destacados</h2>
                <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-brand-gold mx-auto rounded-full my-4"></div>
                <p class="text-stone-400 text-sm">
                    Explora la bibliografía completa de Ahmed Oubali: Novelas de suspenso, crítica semiótica y estudios filológicos.
                </p>

                <!-- Filter Category Buttons -->
                <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mt-8" id="work-filters">
                    <button onclick="filterWorks('all')" class="filter-btn active px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-900">Todas las Obras</button>
                    <button onclick="filterWorks('misterio')" class="filter-btn px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-stone-800 text-stone-300 hover:bg-stone-700">Novela Negra & Misterio</button>
                    <button onclick="filterWorks('ensayo')" class="filter-btn px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-stone-800 text-stone-300 hover:bg-stone-700">Ensayos & Semiótica</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Grid of Works -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8" id="works-grid">
                
                <!-- Book Card 1 -->
                <div class="work-card bg-stone-800/80 rounded-2xl border border-stone-700 overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-gold/60 transition group flex flex-col" data-category="misterio">
                    <div class="aspect-[16/10] bg-stone-900 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-900 to-stone-950">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-skull text-6xl text-brand-gold/30 group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-300"></i>
                        <span class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-red-950/80 text-red-400 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-red-800/50">Novela Noir</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-100 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition">Chivos Expiatorios</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Emblemática novela policiaca ambientada en un entorno fascinante de intriga psicológica y giros narrativos inesperados.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-stone-700 flex justify-between items-center">
                            <span class="text-xs text-stone-400 font-mono">Novela • 226 págs.</span>
                            <button onclick="openBookModal('Chivos Expiatorios', 'Novela referente del género negro hispanomagrebí. Con una sólida construcción narrativa, se adentra en las profundidades de la psicología humana y el misterio.', 'misterio')" class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-gold hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
                                Ver Detalles <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Book Card 2 -->
                <div class="work-card bg-stone-800/80 rounded-2xl border border-stone-700 overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-gold/60 transition group flex flex-col" data-category="misterio">
                    <div class="aspect-[16/10] bg-stone-900 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-900 to-stone-950">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-brain text-6xl text-brand-gold/30 group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-300"></i>
                        <span class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-400 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-800/50">Suspenso</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-100 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition">Narcolepsia & Tétrica Mente</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Dos obras maestras del suspenso psicológico e investigación de la mente asesina y los laberintos de la percepción.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-stone-700 flex justify-between items-center">
                            <span class="text-xs text-stone-400 font-mono">Novela • 212 págs.</span>
                            <button onclick="openBookModal('Narcolepsia / Tétrica Mente', 'Obras cargadas de tensión narrativa y análisis de personajes al límite. Explora los secretos del engaño y las secuelas psicológicas en historias envolventes.', 'misterio')" class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-gold hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
                                Ver Detalles <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Book Card 3 -->
                <div class="work-card bg-stone-800/80 rounded-2xl border border-stone-700 overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-gold/60 transition group flex flex-col" data-category="ensayo">
                    <div class="aspect-[16/10] bg-stone-900 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-900 to-stone-950">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-book-journal-whills text-6xl text-brand-gold/30 group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-300"></i>
                        <span class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-emerald-950/80 text-emerald-400 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-800/50">Semiótica</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-100 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition">La Danza de los Signos</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Estudio semiótico indispensable sobre la literatura marroquí escrita en lengua española y sus códigos culturales.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-stone-700 flex justify-between items-center">
                            <span class="text-xs text-stone-400 font-mono">Ensayo Académico</span>
                            <button onclick="openBookModal('La Danza de los Signos en la literatura marroquí en lengua española', 'Obra teórica fundamental que analiza las estructuras de representación, símbolos y convergencia hispanomagrebí.', 'ensayo')" class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-gold hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
                                Ver Detalles <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pdf-library" class="py-20 bg-stone-100">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-12 border border-stone-200 shadow-xl">
                <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-start lg:items-center gap-6 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-stone-200">
                    <div>
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-red-600 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i> Biblioteca de Libre Acceso
                        </span>
                        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-stone-900 mt-3">Descargas de Libros & Documentos PDF</h2>
                        <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm mt-1">Acceso directo a ensayos, análisis semióticos y publicaciones completas del autor.</p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Search Input for PDFs -->
                    <div class="w-full lg:w-80 relative">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-stone-400 text-sm"></i>
                        <input type="text" id="pdf-search-input" onkeyup="filterPDFs()" placeholder="Buscar publicaciones PDF..." class="w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-stone-300 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-gold">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- PDF Items List -->
                <div class="space-y-4" id="pdf-list-container">
                    
                    <!-- Item 1 -->
                    <div class="pdf-item flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between p-5 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 hover:border-red-300 hover:bg-red-50/20 transition gap-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-stone-900 text-base pdf-title">Tánger en la Novela Policial & Narratología Noir</h4>
                                <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Categoría: Ensayo Policiaco • Idioma: Español • Formato: PDF/eBook</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <a href="https://ahmedoubali.blogspot.com" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-red-700 bg-red-100 hover:bg-red-200 transition flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> Descargar / Ver Blog
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Item 2 -->
                    <div class="pdf-item flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between p-5 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 hover:border-red-300 hover:bg-red-50/20 transition gap-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-stone-900 text-base pdf-title">Iniciación al Análisis Semiótico de Textos</h4>
                                <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Categoría: Filología & Docencia • Idioma: Español • Guía Teórica</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <a href="https://ahmedoubali.blogspot.com" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-red-700 bg-red-100 hover:bg-red-200 transition flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> Descargar / Ver Blog
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Item 3 -->
                    <div class="pdf-item flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between p-5 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 hover:border-red-300 hover:bg-red-50/20 transition gap-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-stone-900 text-base pdf-title">El Poema como Espacio Patémico: Estudio de Pasiones</h4>
                                <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Categoría: Crítica Literaria • Idioma: Español • Estudio Académico</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <a href="https://ahmedoubali.blogspot.com" target="_blank" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-red-700 bg-red-100 hover:bg-red-200 transition flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> Descargar / Ver Blog
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>



    <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-stone-900 via-stone-800 to-brand-900 text-white">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-6">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-gold/20 border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> Asistente Literario con Gemini IA
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold">Generar Análisis del Perfil Intelectual</h2>
            <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto">
